        <Param val="True" valType="bool" updates="None" name="syncScreenRefresh"/>
        <Param val="For the rest of today, you will play two games at the same time! You will play the Arrow Alert Game, just like before. However, you will also play a Face Memory Game.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;To play both games, a face will be quickly shown on the screen before the arrows appear. You must remember this face while also correctly responding to the arrows. A second face will also be shown after you respond to the arrows. However, you only need to remember the first face (the one that appears before the arrows). &amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will then have 4 seconds to choose the first face out of 3 faces by using the buttons L, M, or R. Please note, that the correct face will appear equally often at each triangle location (L, M, and R). You should select each face position about the same number of times if you are doing the task correctly." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
