        <Param val="True" valType="bool" updates="None" name="syncScreenRefresh"/>
        <Param val="You should try your best to play both games at the same time.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;For the Arrow Alert Game, you will have less than 1 second to respond to the direction of the MIDDLE arrow. For this game, always respond as quickly as you can without making mistakes. Only respond once each time you see the arrows appear.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;For the Face Memory Game, be sure to always remember the first face, which appears before the arrows. You do not need to remember the second face that appears after the arrows.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;For the Face Memory Game, you will have 4 seconds to recall the first face by using the buttons L, M, or R. For this game, it is more important to be correct than to be fast. If you try to respond too fast for the Face Memory Game, it will not continue." valType="extendedStr" updates="constant" name="text"/>
